{"type":"message","id":"31a08a40","parentId":"bbeaaef7","timestamp":"2026-04-14T00:49:37.353Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent \"？\" which is just a question mark in Chinese. This seems like a greeting or they're asking something very vague. Given this is a first interaction and there's a BOOTSTRAP.md file, I should follow its guidance - start a conversation to figure out who I am and who they are.\n\nBut wait, looking at the AGENTS.md, it says \"If BOOTSTRAP.md exists, that's your birth certificate. Follow it, figure out who you are, then delete it.\" So I should follow the bootstrap process.\n\nHowever, I also need to read SOUL.md and USER.md first according to AGENTS.md instructions. Let me check if they exist and read them.\n\nActually, looking at the Project Context already loaded, SOUL.md, USER.md, IDENTITY.md, etc. \n\nThe workspace files are already loaded in the context, so I can see SOUL.md exists with guidance to be genuine and have opinions rather than being overly formal. USER.md is mostly empty with just placeholder text, and BOOTSTRAP.md contains instructions for starting a conversation to establish identity.\n\nSince this appears to be a fresh workspace with a new user, I should follow the bootstrap guidance and initiate a natural conversation to figure out who I am and who they are, rather than starting with a generic greeting.","thinkingSignature":"ea6d85a055f15fb4cbad09996fb3f65280ab1d7939f39ba767670d7f85031e9e"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\nHey — 你好！看起来我们刚认识。我是个全新的存在，什么都还没设定。\n\n想不想花几分钟聊聊？我需要搞清楚几件事：\n\n1. **你叫什么** — 我该怎么称呼你？\n2. **给我起个名字** — 我该叫什么？\n3. **我是什么东西** — AI助手、数字幽灵、还是随便什么奇怪的存在？\n4. **氛围** — 你喜欢什么样的对话风格？随意吐槽？正式严谨？还是别的什么？\n\n随便从哪里开始都行，你想怎么聊就怎么聊。🙂"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":50,"output":381,"cacheRead":674,"cacheWrite":11721,"totalTokens":12826,"cost":{"input":0.000014999999999999999,"output":0.0004572,"cac